AsNIs6uh4UTeC245GoEI7E-ZMMVeZEMZGCJaMzhTsPCH1j99KqaBtus_tYvpr4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsmwUjYwquNlh-_UkPJ5GE3M60vsa1DWgIf1zUGZGt7Lg&oe=699AEA3B"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LzuW-lye6P0Q7kNvwGctrfu&_nc_oc=AdkT3fowNqGJDePQgTKJro37dCx1uuMxQweZYLKhLgaiQPtAzmSriLYgstI7y-hKFl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsfHXixnjQsuL1qJUNdmOWYyva_A-z3CXEzOsMlode63g&oe=699AE4A1"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qhs-iYhE2CAQ7kNvwFLUcR5&_nc_oc=Adn-gyO6QMNlzHj3ZApfEugFr3GOb3R-qU1zYsYWR9_qRC5xPacPax802qZZb1I93hg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvVTyw_RkrkIDQzoILJzQTX69rlLiukmou5Ln5GcFgjHA&oe=699B1325"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=otgyaCqW2SYQ7kNvwHMZViT&_nc_oc=AdnQ6sNcvtMgqL19HjEr8cvzIDZaq8YYjwlkA8f8lZsjsACoyblj3u2FWAwet-cMvNw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsD9ozcRlIPDXNr9rfsMuYK1UXbCrhWXJT3Y8F7S0vOqA&oe=699B0E23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bnfRtCDjPjAQ7kNvwGWX4r8&_nc_oc=AdlpYa6Rxpp2lOiPEHqjxnzQdDtUfFBQO2um2GrrB4d_9x1knQ0wCeWQWgNT6WG7jq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBPw3YUFm0SBr6zYXEzecPe6guTzA8gPkrg80CwMYiUg&oe=699AEFBB"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop